WISA STUDIO
===========

WISA STUDIO builds on oh-my-pi's desktop GUI and adds its own desktop
features, Vietnamese defaults, model gateway configuration, and packaging.
The app uses an oh-my-pi-based agent from the WISA-maintained fork.

